      "en": "Joshua and all Israel made as if they were beaten before them, and fled by the way of the wilderness.",
      "ko": "여호수아와 온 이스라엘이 그들 앞에서 거짓 패하여 광야 길로 도망하매",
      "source_text_hash": "23b0f5f5e2202a3fcaa65bdfaaf480a53240a546bd96d26c4d92b8b5dc741dc1",
      "translation_text_hash": "b02eb514658f58938a7403af2fe737bb5eabe1b2052752a97fe3fd4a0b2d9656",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호수아와 온 이스라엘이 그들 앞에서 거짓 패하여 광야 길로 도망하매"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b02eb514658f58938a7403af2fe737bb5eabe1b2052752a97fe3fd4a0b2d9656"
      ]
    },
    {
