      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "All the people who were in the city were called together to pursue after them. They pursued Joshua, and were drawn away from the city.",
      "ko": "그 성 모든 백성이 그들을 따르려고 모여서 여호수아를 따르며 유인함을 입어 성을 멀리 떠나니",
      "source_text_hash": "4c8907e2ccaa5545e06002c32c758b8bdb235b8066fe0df83a55805304b6ebde",
      "translation_text_hash": "9598aa8c65020cdb4d7aace5c821d2b003d33b5115152b23633a8f6619611506",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 성 모든 백성이 그들을 따르려고 모여서 여호수아를 따르며 유인함을 입어 성을 멀리 떠나니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9598aa8c65020cdb4d7aace5c821d2b003d33b5115152b23633a8f6619611506"
