    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOS:8:19",
      "sequence": 6022,
      "chapter_label": "JOS 8",
      "verse_label": "19",
      "locator": {
        "book": "JOS",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 19
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 19
        }
      ],
      "en": "The ambush arose quickly out of their place, and they ran as soon as he had stretched out his hand and entered into the city and took it. They hurried and set the city on fire.",
      "ko": "그 손을 드는 순간에 복병이 그 처소에서 급히 일어나 성읍에 달려 들어가서 점령하고 곧 성읍에 불을 놓았더라",
      "source_text_hash": "4f10c122c1124efeca7a2c046a3db3c458eaaec40385590da9f92b5d51b304a9",
      "translation_text_hash": "ca6be9c9a15c473c6144d5fde377be52309f996072308ff5645ae3b771426681",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 손을 드는 순간에 복병이 그 처소에서 급히 일어나 성읍에 달려 들어가서 점령하고 곧 성읍에 불을 놓았더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ca6be9c9a15c473c6144d5fde377be52309f996072308ff5645ae3b771426681"
